==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|musitian}} {{qualifier|obsolete}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|musician}}, {{m|enm|musicien}}, from {{der|en|fro|musicien|t=musician}}. Equivalent to {{suf|en|music|ian}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{hyphenation|en|mu|si|cian}}
* {{IPA|en|/mjuˈzɪʃən/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-musician.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɪʃən|s=3}}

===Noun===
[[File:Musician - The Noun Project.svg|thumb|150px|A musician playing a {{l|en|guitar}}]]
{{en-noun}}

# A [[composer]], [[conductor]], or a [[performer]] of [[music]]; more specifically, it's a person who sings and/or plays a [[musical instrument]] as a [[hobby]], an [[occupation]], or a [[profession]].
#: {{ux|en|Jenny is a talented '''musician''', playing the cello, saxophone, piano and guitar.}}

